{"3070450": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Night Blood W : Cutthroat Wolf", "steam_appid": 3070450, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Follow Us</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070450/extras/9e61934e101029647493d44f75fd0c94.avif?t=1787804884\" width=1510 height=490 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Nightblood W: Cutthroat Wolf</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Revenge. A promise. The neon abyss.</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You are Loreto, the betrayed Cutthroat Wolf.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This is a cyberpunk 2D side-scrolling pixel action game, and the city is your nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You made a promise to the one you love. You burn for revenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Night after night, through screams and blood, you fight your way up-until the whole neon underworld calls you its ruler.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070450/extras/bf9db019e3932b9dff36cac719f56f9f.avif?t=1787804884\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070450/extras_big/bf9db019e3932b9dff36cac719f56f9f.webp?t=1787804884 width=1560 height=111 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget complicated commands. We built a one‑button combo system – intuitive for veterans and newcomers alike. Tap. Slash. Experience bone‑crushing, blood‑splattering combat at your fingertips.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=